WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:05.480
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, hopefully most
of you have had a chance to see the Walking

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.480
Dead Finale.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.450
I already did my Q&amp;A video answering as many
of the big questions from the episode.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.669
So now it’s time to talk about Season 5,
because they’ve already started releasing

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:15.669
news.

00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:19.510
So what I’m going to do is start with things
that are confirmed and then do my Top 10 predictions

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.890
based on what we know so far.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:26.279
A lot of you have been asking about what kind
of videos I’m doing now that the season

00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:27.279
is over.

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:32.660
I’m going to try and do one Walking Dead
video per week and at least three per month.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.900
More when there’s big news to talk about.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.640
Be sure to subscribe to get everything if
you’re finding me for the first time.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.660
Dragons are coming this week.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:47.570
Walking Dead big news of the day is that Gareth,
Tara and Rosita have all been bumped to series

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.140
regulars for Season 5.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.290
This tells us that one, those characters probably
aren’t going to die anytime soon and it

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.960
means that we might be spending more time
at Terminus than expected.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.120
As in multiple episodes.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.010
I’ll talk more about that during predictions,
but let’s try to answer this really big

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.510
question first.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:09.310
If Rosita is a series regular why aren’t
Abraham and Eugene too?

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:13.509
Series regular means you appear in more episodes,
get more lines.

00:01:13.509 --> 00:01:14.960
Get paid a lot more.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.390
I think it means Abraham and Eugene will be
taking a road trip without Rosita and that

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.810
will just occur off screen for the most part.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:30.210
Now that all the groups are together the first
part of season 5 will probably all just happen

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.210
at Terminus.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.210
On to predictions.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:36.520
So careful for spoilers from the show and
the comic if you’re not caught up.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.520
Here’s my top 10.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:41.520
Starting with Number 10 - Abraham and Eugene
will separate from the group and bolt for

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.990
Alexandria.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.969
During my Q&amp;A I talked about Cannibals eating
the biggest people first and clearly Abraham

00:01:46.969 --> 00:01:52.609
and Eugene would top the list after Tyreese,
but their characters just have way too much

00:01:52.609 --> 00:01:54.740
story left in the comics.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.021
Even if the show remixes everything that’s
supposed to come next, they’d still be a

00:01:58.021 --> 00:01:59.270
part of it.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:05.450
But since they’re not series regulars, having
their story literally “travel” off screen

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.149
would be a good way to start throwing to Alexandria.

00:02:08.149 --> 00:02:14.220
Abraham’s whole mission has been to get
Eugene to DC and he has that stubborn military

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:22.210
mindset and he’s not going to stop until
he accomplishes the mission.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:26.980
Number 9 - Tyreese, Carol and Judith will
still be on the road

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:30.990
There was that lingering shot of powdered
milk outside traincar A that made everyone

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:35.700
wonder if it was being used to feed baby Judith,
but after staring at it a third and fourth

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:40.580
time I think it’s just what they were using
to feed the survivors that we saw, Glenn and

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:41.580
Maggie’s group.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:46.130
Scott Gimple also said something vague on
Talking Dead about them being out there somewhere.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:50.040
We already know Beth’s story is going to
diverge from the rest of the Survivors for

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.060
most of the season.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:56.780
It’s also possible that Carol, Tyreese and
Judith could sidestep Terminus all together.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.210
They’ve already confirmed that there will
be more action in season 5, and wouldn’t

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:04.730
having a baby right there kill all that tension.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:08.000
Rick would do a complete 180 back to farmer
Rick.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.610
So I think that they won’t show up at Terminus,
at least, not while shit is going down between

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.030
the Survivors and the cannibals.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:17.900
As much as I want to see Rick and Carl reunited
with Judith, by not being there, she’ll

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.980
be spared being turned into a hamburger.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:25.090
Number 8 - The first half of the season will
all be at Terminus

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:29.721
Gareth is a series regular now, there wouldn’t
be a reason to make him one if the Survivors

00:03:29.721 --> 00:03:33.310
were going to blow right through on their
way to Alexandria.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:37.960
So them escaping and defeating the cannibals
is just going to cross over several episodes.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:43.190
Which I think is great, they teased so much
mythology in the five actual minutes of Terminus

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.190
we saw.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.270
We’ll get to learn all about the creepy
religion they practice, what the candles are

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:50.070
for and the history of Terminus.

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:53.370
They wrote those creepy mantra’s on the
wall for a reason.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:58.310
Clearly the Saviors or someone bad came there
at some point and took advantage of them.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:04.090
This isn’t a prediction, but wouldn’t
it be crazy if the Saviors came and took all

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:10.520
their supplies at some point in the past and
that’s what induced them to cannibalism.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.970
Negan took all their food.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:19.389
Number 7 - The people are at Terminus are
actually a cannibalistic cult.

00:04:19.389 --> 00:04:24.840
Here’s where we need to distinguish the
act of eating human flesh from what happens

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.400
in that weird shrine.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:31.419
If they were just cannibals they would eat
people out of extreme necessity.

00:04:31.419 --> 00:04:35.020
The people at Terminus sitting around that
grill seemed like they were very well fed.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.669
Meaning they probably overate.

00:04:36.669 --> 00:04:41.590
Like they ate steak three times a day, when
they probably could have survived on a fraction

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.379
of that.

00:04:43.379 --> 00:04:47.130
In order to get all that meat, they would
have had to have killed a lot of people, if

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:51.499
you look at the bones on that tarp Rick runs
by, not only are there remains of several

00:04:51.499 --> 00:04:53.509
people, they look recent.

00:04:53.509 --> 00:04:57.050
Old bones would have been way more bleached
looking and there wouldn’t be any blood

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.460
left on them.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:03.389
By the way, Rick definitely took a long look
and saw that they were human bones.

00:05:03.389 --> 00:05:05.060
Even if he hasn’t said anything yet.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:11.029
The ritual aspect of whatever is going on
is what the real mystery is.

00:05:11.029 --> 00:05:16.129
I’m actually wondering if they’re worshipping
something ethereal like the Virus or if they’re

00:05:16.129 --> 00:05:17.500
praying to a god.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:22.849
I look forward to Rick trapping Gareth in
a classic evil guy monologue where he explains

00:05:22.849 --> 00:05:25.610
their whole plan.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.169
Incredibles shout out anyone?

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:28.750
You caught me monologuing!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:37.150
Number 6 - Denise Crosby’s Mary leads them
with Gareth, but there is no big bad.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:41.530
Gareth is definitely not a big bad like the
Governor, but he does have authority.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:45.919
And from the way everyone treated Denise Crosby,
it looks like she’s the evil Hershel of

00:05:45.919 --> 00:05:46.919
their group.

00:05:46.919 --> 00:05:50.020
I sense a nice dicotomy between the prison
and Terminus.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:54.050
As in Terminus is just an evil universe version
of the prison.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.889
Start looking for who everyone’s evil twin
is.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:59.699
If this were Star Trek they’d all have beards.

00:05:59.699 --> 00:06:02.620
Speaking of which, let’s talk about Denise
Crosby.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.620
They wouldn’t cast someone like her in a
throwaway role, I think it’s just more evidence

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:09.110
that Terminus is ruled by a council.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:13.479
I’d call them the Legion of Doom, but that’s
really what the Saviors are.

00:06:13.479 --> 00:06:19.360
Number 5 - One of the survivors has probably
eaten some people meat.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:23.710
A lot of people thought the voices coming
from that other container were Beth, Carol

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:24.710
and Tyreese.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.400
But they sound too different to be them.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.300
I think they’re going to be redshirt characters
that Rick and the survivors will watch get

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.590
sacrificed in episode 1.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:38.389
Terminus is threatening because of all those
guns, they need to witness someone getting

00:06:38.389 --> 00:06:41.279
eaten for it to become horrifying.

00:06:41.279 --> 00:06:45.740
Who else noticed how many times Rick and Michonne
talked about being hungry, about how there

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.800
was no food.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.580
They have to eat at some point, and for the
time being, they can only eat what the Terminus

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.749
people feed them.

00:06:52.749 --> 00:06:55.759
And what do they have to give, people meat.

00:06:55.759 --> 00:07:03.960
I just feel like at least one of the survivors
has already taken a bite of steak without

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.199
realizing what it was.

00:07:05.199 --> 00:07:07.550
I’d say Abraham would be my first candidate.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.380
Something about him just screams steak and
potatoes.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.650
Number 4 - They will make it to Alexandria,
but not till the end of the season.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:18.139
All Abraham has been talking about since he
appeared has been Washington.

00:07:18.139 --> 00:07:23.500
The traincar they were locked in had a giant
A on it and had a NW for Northwest.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.240
We all expect them to get there eventually.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:30.339
But based on the casting upgrades that included
Gareth, it became pretty clear that Alexandria

00:07:30.339 --> 00:07:32.779
is much further in the distance.

00:07:32.779 --> 00:07:34.080
I think it’s a good thing.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:38.550
Once they get there it’s all Saviors then
downhill.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.599
Right now in the comics there’s the All
Out War storyline.

00:07:41.599 --> 00:07:46.650
I think for them to jump to that before Season
6 or 7 is just way too soon.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:51.530
If you’re reading the comics then you can
take comfort in something Robert Kirkman said.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:56.650
Basically that all of the things you think
are coming are coming, the difference is that

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.249
the show remixes stuff.

00:07:58.249 --> 00:08:03.869
So you still get those big comic book things,
they just might not be exactly the same.

00:08:03.869 --> 00:08:09.560
For example the character Gareth is a twist
on is probably a version of Chris, the leader

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:10.810
of the Hunters.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:17.710
If you haven’t you should check out Volume
11 Fear the Hunters.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.479
It covers all things cannibalism.

00:08:20.479 --> 00:08:24.909
Number 3 - Rick will say his famous line in
episode 1.

00:08:24.909 --> 00:08:29.680
Rewind a little in the comics from the Hunters.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.500
Rick has this famous line, “We Are the Walking
Dead”.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:41.930
I kept expecting him to say it in the finale,
in a twist from the comic.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.930
Like as a battle cry.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:48.029
He ended up saying they messed with the wrong
people, but I’m holding out hope he’ll

00:08:48.029 --> 00:08:51.240
say it in season 5.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:56.641
Number 2 - Beth’s storyline in Season 5
will follow a different path from the Survivors

00:08:56.641 --> 00:08:58.420
and we won’t see her as much.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:04.190
Robert Kirkman has said that they are remixing
things from the comics, and didn’t confirm

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.329
or deny anything about who took her.

00:09:06.329 --> 00:09:09.100
But we will see her.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:10.880
Just not with the Survivors.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.560
I think it was Jesus that took her, or they’ll
combine his character with father Gabriel.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.450
Either way she’s on her way to Alexandria.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.910
Even if she doesn’t get there right away,
she’ll still spend most of the season apart

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.149
from the Survivors.

00:09:24.149 --> 00:09:28.690
That foreshadowing from the finale, there’s
a new sheriff in town, implies that she’ll

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:30.570
become a little more of a badass.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:34.220
I think that’s what all those hunting scenes
with Daryl were about and her moment with

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.220
the spoon.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:40.220
By the time she is reunited with the Survivors
I think she’ll just be more like Carol,

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.360
a slightly less hardcore version of Carol.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:45.740
No matter how awesome Beth gets, I don’t
think she’ll be the kind of person that

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:47.399
could kill a child.

00:09:47.399 --> 00:09:51.269
Number 1 - We won’t see Negan until they
get to Alexandria.

00:09:51.269 --> 00:09:53.290
Which may not happen until the very end of
the season.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:57.699
Based on Gareth being upgraded to cast regular
I think he’s going to be around for a long

00:09:57.699 --> 00:09:59.800
time and in a lot of episodes.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:02.899
Meaning there really isn’t room in the narrative
for Negan yet.

00:10:02.899 --> 00:10:07.810
Him showing up is entirely dependent on when
they arrive at Alexandria, and even then it

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.850
might be another repeat of what happened in
this finale.

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:15.440
You get a flash of Alexandria for 5 minutes
and we get introduced to him and that’s

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.440
it.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.680
They leave all the character development and
explanations for Season 6.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:23.090
It even possible that they could push him
all the way to the end of season 6.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.090
AMC has had a recent history of sticking to
about 7 seasons.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.090
Or like with Mad Men where they do 7 seasons
and split it into two years to make it seem

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.090
like 8 seasons.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.779
Now it’s your turn, let me know what your
predictions are for season 5.

00:10:27.779 --> 00:10:30.170
How long do you think they’ll stay at Terminus?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:36.550
And if Beth’s story is going to be apart
from them, is she being taken to Alexandria?

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:40.490
My next bonus video will probably post next
week.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:47.480
Now that Game of Thrones is so close I’m
going to focus more on that.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.959
Be sure to subscribe to get all of that.

00:10:49.959 --> 00:10:53.770
And leave me suggestions for anything you
want in those bonus videos.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:56.860
Right Now click here for my finale video and
click here for the Q&amp;A.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.610
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight!

